        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sannaddii Barakada Rabbiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruuxii Sayidka Rabbiga ah ayaa i dul jooga, waayo, wuxuu Rabbigu ii subkay inaan war wanaagsan masaakiinta ku wacdiyo, wuxuuna ii soo diray inaan kuwa qalbiga jaban bogsiiyo, iyo inaan maxaabiista xornimada ogeysiiyo, kuwa xidhanna furriinnimada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo inaan dadka ogeysiiyo sannadda qaabbilaadda ah ee Rabbiga iyo maalintii aarsashada Ilaahayaga, iyo inaan kuwa baroorta oo dhan u qalbi qaboojiyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo inaan kuwa Siyoon ku baroorta meeshii dambaska qurux madaxooda ka saaro, oo meeshii baroorashadana aan saliiddii farxadda ka siiyo, oo meeshii qalbijabna aan dharkii ammaanta ka siiyo, in iyaga lagu magacaabo geedihii xaqnimada iyo beeriddii Rabbiga, si uu isagu u ammaanmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyagu waxay dhisi doonaan burburkii hore, oo waxay kor u taagi doonaan wixii waa hore dumay, oo waxay cusboonayn doonaan magaalooyinkii burburay iyo wixii qarniyo badan baabba' ahaan jiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo shisheeyayaalna halkaasay joogi doonaan adhigiinnay daajin doonaan, oo kuwa qariibka ahuna waxay idiin noqon doonaan beerfalayaal iyo kuwa beercanabka ka shaqeeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse idinka waxaa laydinku magacaabi doonaa wadaaddadii Rabbiga, oo dadku waxay idiinku yeedhi doonaan midiidinnadii Ilaahayaga. Waxaad cuni doontaan maalka quruumaha, oo sharaftooda ayaad ku faani doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeshii ceebtiinna sharaf labanlaab ah baad ka heli doontaan, oo meeshii qasmiddana waxay ku rayrayn doonaan qaybtooda, sidaas daraaddeed iyagu dalkooda qayb labanlaab ah bay ku hantiyi doonaan, oo waxaa iyaga u ahaan doonta farxad weligeed ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, anigoo Rabbiga ahu caddaalad baan jeclahay, waxdhicidda iyo xumaantase waan nebcahay. Si daacad ah ayaan iyaga ugu abaalgudi doonaa, oo waxaan la dhigan doonaa axdi weligiis ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo farcankoodana quruumahaa lagu dhex aqoon doonaa, oo carruurtoodana dadyowga dhexdoodaa lagu aqoon doonaa, oo wax alla wixii iyaga arka oo dhammuba way aqoonsan doonaan inay iyagu yihiin farcankii Rabbigu barakeeyey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si weyn baan Rabbiga ugu rayrayn doonaa, oo naftayduna Ilaahayga bay ku farxi doontaa, waayo, wuxuu ii xidhay dharkii badbaadada, oo wuxuu i huwiyey khamiiskii xaqnimada, sida aroos dharkiisa quruxdasan isku sharraxa iyo sida aroosad jowharadaheeda isku soo sharraxda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, sida dhulku biqilkiisa u soo bixiyo, iyo sida beertu wixii lagu dhex abuuray u soo bixiso, ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu ka dhigi doonaa in xaqnimo iyo ammaanu ay quruumaha oo dhan ka soo hor baxaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
